  "text": "## Estimated Timeline\n\nDesign timelines depend on product complexity and screen volume:\n\n- **Focused Web / Mobile Application (10 to 15 Screens)**: 3 to 5 weeks from discovery to final handoff.\n- **Full SaaS Product & Admin Dashboard System**: 5 to 8 weeks from discovery to final handoff.\n- **Comprehensive Multi-Platform Design System**: 8 to 12 weeks from discovery to final handoff.\n\n---",
